relaciones:
If structure catMCELeve1 is configured, the following conditions must be fulfilled:
1) the relationship between catMCELevel1-mpdcchMaxNumRepCatM and catMCELevel1-mpdcchRepLevCatM must be fulfilled:
1.1) If the catMCELevel1-mpdcchMaxNumRepCatM is set to 'r1' then catMCELevel1-mpdcchRepLevCatM must be set to 'n1';
1.2) If the catMCELevel1-mpdcchMaxNumRepCatM is set to 'r2' then catMCELevel1-mpdcchRepLevCatM must be set to 'n1' or 'n2';
1.3) If the catMCELevel1-mpdcchMaxNumRepCatM is set to 'r4' then catMCELevel1-mpdcchRepLevCatM must be set to 'n1', or 'n2', or 'n3'.

2) srProhibitTimerCatM must not set to '0' if following condition is fulfilled:
- catMCELevel1-mpdcchMaxNumRepCatM>= '32' and catMCELevel1-pucchF1NumRepModeACatM>= '4';
 (please refer the rules defined in srProhibitTimerCatM)

1) the relationship between mpdcchMaxNumRepPagCatM and catMCELevel1-mpdcchRepLevPagCatM must be fulfilled:
1.1) If the mpdcchMaxNumRepPagCatM is set to 'n1', then catMCELevel1-mpdcchRepLevPagCatM must be set to 'n1';
1.2) If the mpdcchMaxNumRepPagCatM is set to 'n2', then catMCELevel1-mpdcchRepLevPagCatM must be set to 'n1' or 'n2';
1.3) If the mpdcchMaxNumRepPagCatM is set to the values from {'n4','n8', 'n16', 'n32', 'n64', 'n128', 'n256'},  then catMCELevel1-mpdcchRepLevPagCatM must be set to 'n1', or 'n2', or 'n3';

2)the relationship between catMCELevel1-mpdcchRepLevPagCatM and catMCELevel1-pdschRepLevPagCatM must be fulfilled:
