relaciones:
if ttibOperMode is set to any of (sinrBasedNotWithMeasGap, sinrBasedTtibOnAllowed, sinrBasedTtibOnOffAllowed):
- ttibSinrThresholdOut and ttibSinrThresholdIn must be configured in LNCEL instance with cellTechnology is 'FDD' or 'TDD'
- ttibSinrThresholdOut must be >= ttibSinrThresholdIn + 1 dB

if ttibOperMode is set to any of (sinrBasedNotWithMeasGap, sinrBasedTtibOnAllowed, sinrBasedTtibOnOffAllowed), 
- ttibSinrThresholdOut and ttibSinrThresholdIn must be configured in LNCEL instance with cellTechnology is 'FDD' or 'TDD'
- ttibSinrThresholdOut must be >= ttibSinrThresholdIn + 1 dB

(1) "cssProfNBRobCov-npdcchMaxNumRepRa" must be equal to one of the values from "schedProfNBRobCov-iniNpdcchNumRepRa" multiple with {1, 2, 4 or 8}
(2)For any LNCEL instance with 'numCoverageLevels' >= 2 then "schedProfNBNorCov-iniNpdcchNumRepRa" <= "schedProfNBRobCov-iniNpdcchNumRepRa"
(3)For any LNCEL instance with 'numCoverageLevels' = 3 then "schedProfNBRobCov-iniNpdcchNumRepRa" <= "schedProfNBExtCov-iniNpdcchNumRepRa"
